  1.22.6  FIX: chest names are hidden while the inventory, map, shop or text box is open.
  1.22.5  CHANGE: chest names are neon green (#39FF14) by default, in the floating text and in the hover text.
  1.22.4  CHANGE: chest names are now drawn in the middle of the chest instead of above it. The middle is worked out from the chest's
          own size (so it is right for every chest type and turns with the chest), and LabelHeight (now default 0) is an
          extra lift on top of that.
  1.22.3  FIX: the Feather collector and the Chain recipe were not showing up. Both are added when the game's item database is
          ready, but they were tried only once, at a moment when the database could still be empty (it is filled in a later step),
          and a failed first try was never repeated. They are now retried from several hooks (item database awake and copy,
          world start) and about once a second in the world until they succeed, and Chain is also found by its item name.
  1.22.2  CHANGE: sails are now 90% transparent by default (SailOpacity 0.1).
  1.22.1  PERFORMANCE: (1) Transparent sails took ~40 ms every 2 s: the game has no 'Sail' class, so the lookup searched every loaded
          assembly each time and found nothing (sails never became transparent either). Sails are now found through the Ship
          class (its sail object), and the shader is looked up once. (2) "Build hammer removes any piece" no longer scans the
          area every second: it is applied once, when a piece loads or is placed. (3) Station output looks for stations every
          3 s instead of every second.
  1.22.0  NEW: food duration multiplier. Food you eat lasts FoodDurationMultiplier times as long (2 = twice as long, 0.5 = half as
          long). New settings in section 18: EnableFoodDurationMultiplier, FoodDurationMultiplier.
